menu "OTA update check"

    config OTA_UPDATE_CHECK_REPO
        string "GitHub repository to check for firmware releases"
        default "scheeles/ep-s20-otbr"
        help
            Repository the device queries for new releases, as "owner/repo".

            This is only the factory default: it can be changed at runtime from the
            OTA page in the web UI, which stores it in NVS. Set it to whichever fork
            actually publishes the firmware these devices run — a device pointed at a
            repository someone else releases from will offer updates it should not.

endmenu
